# Components overview canonical list

This rule defines the mandatory canonical format for the component list in `docs/components/overview.md`.

## Required entry format

Each component entry MUST use exactly this markdown bullet format:

`- [Display Name](snake_case.md)`

Rules:

- `Display Name`: human-readable component name.
- Link target: local file name only, in `snake_case.md`.
- No absolute URLs, no nested paths, no query params.

## Mandatory ordering

The list MUST be sorted alphabetically by normalized `Display Name`:

- trim leading/trailing spaces
- collapse internal whitespace to one space
- compare case-insensitively

Tie-breaker:

- sort by link target (`snake_case.md`) ascending, case-insensitive.

## Synchronization guarantees

`docs/components/overview.md` MUST be synchronized with `docs/components/*.md` (excluding `overview.md`):

- No orphan docs (component file exists but is not listed).
- No dead links (listed file does not exist).
- No duplicate entries by display name.
- No duplicate entries by link target.

## Determinism requirement

On repeated runs with unchanged component docs, `overview.md` MUST remain byte-stable (no list churn, no non-deterministic reordering).
